-- INSERT IGNORE for taxonomy + relations, so it is safe to re-run.
-- Status: publish -> published, draft/private -> draft (private stays hidden).
-- Images keep their original saptatunas.com URLs (template renders full URLs).
-- To host images on this site instead, the client must provide the WordPress
-- media library (wp-content/uploads); then the URLs can be rewritten.
-- Large file: import via phpMyAdmin Import (raise upload limit) or mysql CLI.
-- =============================================================================
