INSERT INTO `blog` (`judul`,`slug`,`user_id`,`konten`,`excerpt`,`gambar_utama`,`status`,`created_at`,`updated_at`) VALUES ('Sapta Tunas Teknologi – Most Valuable Partner of FY20','sapta-tunas-teknologi-most-valuable-partner-of-fy20',NULL,'<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img class="wp-image-14341" src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Most-Valuable-Partner-of-FY20.png" alt="" /></figure>

<p>Jakarta – 25<sup>th</sup> July,2019 once again this year prove that Sapta Tunas Teknologi keep growing and has best performance in providing the best IT Solution and Services to our customers and valuable for our Partner, Dell Technologies.</p>

<p>Sapta Tunas Teknologi was recognized as the Most Valuable Partner of FY20. Though the event that held in Partner Business Conference Webinar on the last July 03, 2020 It doesn’t mean We lose our enthusiastic to attend this event. Moreover, we get two awards for this year.</p>

<p>This was a second year in a row that Sapta Tunas Teknologi has been awarded as Most Valuable Partner. This award given based on the company’s accomplishments in 2019. It means also that STT has succesfully shows and works to high commitment in profesionalism, business excellence and good services. It’s a fuel to STT team to do more and approach to our customer to fulfill their IT Solutions need, moreover in todays challenge.</p>

<p>All the awards is the result of STT Team effort. Thanks to all our team and keep moving to give the best to our client.   </p>','Jakarta – 25 th July,2019 once again this year prove that Sapta Tunas Teknologi keep growing and has best performance in providing the best IT Solution and Services to our customers and valuable fo…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Most-Valuable-Partner-of-FY20.png','published','2023-07-04','2023-07-04')
