INSERT INTO `blog` (`judul`,`slug`,`user_id`,`konten`,`excerpt`,`gambar_utama`,`status`,`created_at`,`updated_at`) VALUES ('Be Ready to Adapt. Choose Your Future Storage.','be-ready-to-adapt-choose-your-future-storage',NULL,'Storage for data company is very crucial to run the business. Now, we enter the data era, the combination of massive amounts of data and technology innovation provides the opportunity for business to transform into disruptive, digital powerhouses. All the activities in company should be managed and saved in a safe &amp; structured storage. But It often requires company to have a large space and flexible management. Accros industries face this case. Data makes them compete in todays competition and grab their customer or goals. If They don’t have and prepare the best IT tools for their storage, may the company will run slower than the others.

In today’s fast-moving digital economy, in order to remain competitive and relevant, businesses need to optimize their IT operations in line with modern applicaton workloads. The sheer volume of data being generated within modern organization is straggering, and often overwhelming. Why you need to optimize your IT? As ESG survey shows enterprises that optimize their IT are able to:
<ul>
 	<li>Improve operational efficiency</li>
 	<li>Enhance business agility</li>
 	<li>Optimize service predictability</li>
 	<li>Reduce costs</li>
</ul>
PowerStore is Dell Technologies next generation storage appliance. It provides customers with an infrastructure that will accelerate digital transformation. Designed for the data era, PowerStore supports both traditional and modern workloads – from edge, to core, to cloud. With PowerStore, Dell EMC and Intel have extended their development of SCM powered by Intel Optane technology into another industry leading solution as a missing critical storage device.

3 Benefits that Dell PowerStore provides for you :
<figure><img width="75" height="75" src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Data-centric-design.png" alt=""></figure>
<h3>Data-centric Design</h3>
To optimize storage efficiency, scalability and system performance.
<figure><img width="75" height="75" src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Intelligent-Automotive.png" alt=""></figure>
<h3>Intelligent automation</h3>
That simplifies management and optimizes sytem resource, while enabling proactive  health analytics.
<figure><img width="75" height="75" src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Adaptibality.png" alt=""></figure>
<h3>Adapability</h3>
That enables speed and application mobility, as well as flexible deployment models and payment solutions.

PowerStore is designed to support any workload by delivering unified storage (physical or virtual, file-based, or container-based) in a performance optimized appliance that supports end-to-end NVME and can scale up and out when demands increase. It also delivers efficiency without compromise with always on inline data reduction. Dell Technologies and Sapta Tunas will assist you for your new storage to be ready in future challenges.','Storage for data company is very crucial to run the business. Now, we enter the data era, the combination of massive amounts of data and technology innovation provides the opportunity for business …','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Feature-Image.png','draft','2020-06-08','2020-06-08')
