INSERT INTO `blog` (`judul`,`slug`,`user_id`,`konten`,`excerpt`,`gambar_utama`,`status`,`created_at`,`updated_at`) VALUES ('Now Are The Era of Digital Transformation','now-are-the-era-of-digital-transformation',NULL,'<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/1585-e1563593710845.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-12420"/></figure>

<p><strong>Digital Transformation</strong>&nbsp;puts technology at the heart of an organization’s products, services and operations—to help accelerate the business and competitively differentiate itself—to improve the experience for its customers. This is achieved using smarter products, data analytics and continuous improvement of products and services through the use of software.</p>

<p>The goal of digital transformation is for an organization to be able to deliver a differentiated product or service to the market—whether through a capability that nobody else offers, or the speed with which one can offer it. In doing so, an organization becomes the trusted, go-to option for its target customers.</p>

<p><strong>IT Transformation</strong>&nbsp;is an initiative to accelerate the digital delivery of modern IT services and applications that can differentiate a business, its products and operations. To transform IT, organizations must follow a well-planned strategy. Regardless of industry and IT maturity at the company, the strategy includes three critical steps:</p>

<p>•&nbsp;	Modernizing critical IT infrastructure so that it is efficient in terms of operational expense and management overhead</p>

<p>•&nbsp;	Automating IT processes to reduce risk and accelerate the provisioning and deployment of applications&nbsp;</p>

<p>•	Transforming IT processes and operations to align IT staff and roles as tightly as possible to the business and its customers</p>','Digital Transformation puts technology at the heart of an organization’s products, services and operations—to help accelerate the business and competitively differentiate itself—to improve the expe…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1585-scaled.jpg','draft','2019-07-26','2019-07-26')
  ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `judul`=VALUES(`judul`),`konten`=VALUES(`konten`),`excerpt`=VALUES(`excerpt`),`gambar_utama`=VALUES(`gambar_utama`),`status`=VALUES(`status`),`created_at`=VALUES(`created_at`),`updated_at`=VALUES(`updated_at`);
INSERT INTO `blog` (`judul`,`slug`,`user_id`,`konten`,`excerpt`,`gambar_utama`,`status`,`created_at`,`updated_at`) VALUES ('Empower Your Data Protection','empower-your-data-protection',NULL,'<p> As data is asset for Organization. Means, IT Department has to concern about data and data protection also &amp; what IT tools They use for. By data, organization can conquer their target market. Organization can’t work without data. Can you imagine if Data isn’t a big issue for company? How long your business going well without any data protection? Why you should concern about It now? See, Sapta Tunas Teknologi &amp; Dell Technologies will answer what you worry about.  </p>

<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/7-1-640x200.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-13113"/></figure>

<p>Data provide you the information of your needs
to works your business as your goals. Protect your data means protect your
future business. It will take you to the place of market you wanna stand for. </p>

<p>Data is&nbsp;
organization most powerful asset. Data enables the insights that
separate your organization from the competition. That’s why it’s imperative to
unlock the value of your data capital. Modern IT takes into account where data
resides, how It’s managed and how it’s protected. </p>

<p>Today, Organizations face many challenges and
conflicting priorities. First and foremost, data growth and democratization of
data with the ownership of&nbsp; data
transferring from IT to the users of the data (e.g. the line of business) is
greatly impacting the data protection strategies deployed by customers. Data is
expected to reach 44 ZB by 2020. Pressure continues to mount for businesses to
use and protect data more strategically to harness business opportunities, more
effectivel manage existing applications and enable next-generation business
applications. &nbsp;So, the data protection solutions today need to be abe to scale with
data growthm efficiently, effectively and economically, protect growing data,
and provide visibility to key stakeholders including application/data owners. </p>

<p>Second, with digital transformation, the
applications ecosystem that IT needs to manage and protect continues to grow.
So, the data protection solutions need to efficiently and effectively protect
data closer to the source for a diverse and wide applications ecosystem while
reducing cost and complexity and meeting stringent compliance and security
regulations. </p>

<p>Third, the accelerating use of cloud – private,
hybrid and public – represents another key challeng. Research indicates that
70% of CIOs have a cloud first strategy and 85% of enterprises will be
multi-cloud by 2018. So, the data protection strategies and solutions need to
enable the smooth and seamless addition of cloud to the IT strategy. </p>

<p>Fourth, business cycles continue to shrink from
multiple decades in the past to years today. Organizations want to dramatically
improve the time to value for their IT investments and focus on business gowth
and revenuw generating initiatives. As business owners on-board new
applications, IT is expected to have data protection available for these new
applications without impacting business agility. This has led to emergence and
adoption of converged and turnkey data-protection solutions that accelerate the
time to protection while reducing TCO.

So,
It’s time to you get serious about data protection for your business journey
with Sapta Tunas Teknologi &amp; Dell Technologies.

</p>','As data is asset for Organization. Means, IT Department has to concern about data and data protection also & what IT tools They use for. By data, organization can conquer their target market. Organ…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/6.jpg','draft','2019-11-29','2019-11-29')
  ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `judul`=VALUES(`judul`),`konten`=VALUES(`konten`),`excerpt`=VALUES(`excerpt`),`gambar_utama`=VALUES(`gambar_utama`),`status`=VALUES(`status`),`created_at`=VALUES(`created_at`),`updated_at`=VALUES(`updated_at`);
