INSERT INTO `blog` (`judul`,`slug`,`user_id`,`konten`,`excerpt`,`gambar_utama`,`status`,`created_at`,`updated_at`) VALUES ('(untitled)','post-2',NULL,'<p>The recent rapid advancements of information and computing technologies can stimulate industrial and human development in future. In processing power and connectivity big data we need best solution to fulfillment of data information quickly and accurately. For decades, High Performance Computing (HPC) has been a powerful tool solution for big data processing.</p>

<p><strong><strong>Why Dell EMC Ready for HPC?</strong></strong></p>

<p>Looking the current market needs, Sapta Tunas Teknologi have flexible solutions that can help solve complex problems faster than before. HPC solution delivers the compute, throughput and capacity needed to manage the rapid data growth and increased workload demands. Dell&nbsp;EMC Ready Solutions for HPC speed time to results with the confidence of engineering-tested.</p>

<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile" style="grid-template-columns:15% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Picture1-removebg-preview.png" alt="" class="wp-image-13511 size-full"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p><strong>Dell EMC Ready Solutions for HPC Digital Manufacturing</strong></p>

<p>This HPC solution designed specially for digital manufacturing workloads with combine compute, storage and networking into a single, easy-to manage solution and can help reduce design cycle time and errors.</p>
</div></div>

<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile" style="grid-template-columns:auto 15%"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Picture2-removebg-preview.png" alt="" class="wp-image-13512 size-full"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p><strong><strong>Dell EMC Ready Solutions for HPC Life Sciences</strong></strong></p>

<p>This HPC solution deliver results and identify treatments in clinically relevant timeframes, maintain compliance and protect confidential data with doing modernize while being ready for future growth.</p>
</div></div>

<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile" style="grid-template-columns:15% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Picture3-removebg-preview.png" alt="" class="wp-image-13513 size-full"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p><strong>Dell EMC Ready Solutions for HPC Reasearch</strong></p>

<p>This HPC solution trusted design, tested and tuned for research workloads like servers, storage, networking, software and services proven in our labs and in customer deployments with modular solution building block for deploying new clasters, scaling or ugrading existing environment.</p>
</div></div>

<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile" style="grid-template-columns:auto 15%"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Picture4-removebg-preview.png" alt="" class="wp-image-13514 size-full"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p><strong>Dell EMC Ready Solutions for HPC NFS Storage</strong></p>

<p>This HPC solution designed easy to deploy and manage for lower I/O needs (reduce cost in a reliable, easy to administer, industry-standard solution) and higher I/O requipments (good secondary storge repository option for directorities, application storage and longer term storge of application data).</p>
</div></div>

<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile" style="grid-template-columns:15% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Picture5-removebg-preview.png" alt="" class="wp-image-13515 size-full"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p><strong>Dell EMC Ready Solutions for HPC Lustre Storage</strong></p>

<p>This HPC solution trusted design with scale endlessly for delivers unmatched I/O levels and efficient scaling, both up and down, without losing performance or capacity.</p>
</div></div>

<p>In addition to that solution, Sapta Tunas Teknologi also provide IT consultation for customized HPC solution for your current company needs.</p>

<p><strong>Why Sapta Tunas Teknologi?</strong></p>

<p>Sapta Tunas Teknologi have strong commitment in helping customer to reach their organizational goals and designing IT solution fit their company needs that keeping with current technological trends.</p>

<ul><li>Dedicated Teams&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Certified Engineer&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Award – Winning</li><li>Demo Solutions Center</li><li>Trusted Partner</li></ul>

<p><strong>Source Reference:</strong></p>

<p><a href="https://www.delltechnologies.com/asset/en-id/products/ready-solutions/briefs-summaries/ready-solutions-for-hpc-solution-overview.pdf">https://www.delltechnologies.com/asset/en-id/products/ready-solutions/briefs-summaries/ready-solutions-for-hpc-solution-overview.pdf</a></p>

<p><a href="https://www.dellemc.com/en-us/solutions/high-performance-computing/hpc-ai-centers-of-excellence.htm">https://www.dellemc.com/en-us/solutions/high-performance-computing/hpc-ai-centers-of-excellence.htm</a></p>','The recent rapid advancements of information and computing technologies can stimulate industrial and human development in future. In processing power and connectivity big data we need best solution…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/hpc-website4-01.png','draft','2021-10-24','2021-10-24')
