<p class="has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color"><a href="https://www.delltechnologies.com/asset/en-id/products/storage/briefs-summaries/h18839-dell-emc-powerstore-500-top-reasons.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.delltechnologies.com/asset/en-id/products/storage/briefs-summaries/h18839-dell-emc-powerstore-500-top-reasons.pdf</a></p>','Dell EMC PowerStore telah mencapai tingkat kelincahan dan fleksibilitas operasional baru untuk infrastruktur TI cloud-mobile saat ini. Dengan menggunakan perangkat lunak kontainer, PowerStore 500 m…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/mengapa-ps500_website-09.png','published','2023-07-04','2023-07-04')
