<p class="has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color"><a href="https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/difference-between-lan-and-wan/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/difference-between-lan-and-wan/</a> </p>

<p class="has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color"><a href="https://www.naukri.com/learning/articles/difference-between-lan-and-wan/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.naukri.com/learning/articles/difference-between-lan-and-wan/</a></p>

