<p class="has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color"><a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/resources/cloud-computing-dictionary/what-is-paas/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/resources/cloud-computing-dictionary/what-is-paas/</a></p>

