<p><a href="https://www.techtarget.com/searchdatabackup/tip/Comparing-data-protection-vs-data-security-vs-data-privacy">https://www.techtarget.com/searchdatabackup/tip/Comparing-data-protection-vs-data-security-vs-data-privacy</a></p>

<p><a href="https://termly.io/resources/articles/data-privacy-vs-data-security-vs-data-protection/">https://termly.io/resources/articles/data-privacy-vs-data-security-vs-data-protection/</a></p>','Data adalah aset penting perusahaan yang harus dilindungi dan diamankan selama pengembangan. Ada begitu banyak cara data organisai berpotensi hilang atau dikompromikan, organisasi harus mengambil p…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Website-1-1.png','published','2023-07-04','2023-07-04')
