<p><a href="https://www.dell.com/en-au/dt/solutions/openmanage/enterprise.htm#tab0=0&amp;pdf-overlay=//www.delltechnologies.com/asset/en-au/products/servers/briefs-summaries/dell_emc_openmanage_enterprise_solution_brief.pdf">https://www.dell.com/en-au/dt/solutions/openmanage/enterprise.htm#tab0=0&amp;pdf-overlay=//www.delltechnologies.com/asset/en-au/products/servers/briefs-summaries/dell_emc_openmanage_enterprise_solution_brief.pdf</a></p>','Setiap orang atau perusahaan pasti memiliki sejumlah aset TI, mulai dari perangkat keras seperti komputer, server, dan printer, hingga perangkat lunak seperti aplikasi bisnis dan sistem operasi. Na…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/web-IT-Invent-3.png','published','2023-09-28','2023-09-28')
