<a href="https://www.modmed.com/resources/blog/choosing-public-vs-private-cloud-for-medical-software">https://www.modmed.com/resources/blog/choosing-public-vs-private-cloud-for-medical-software</a>

<a href="https://www.t-systems.com/de/en/insights/newsroom/expert-blogs/healthcare-transformation-with-private-cloud-711666">https://www.t-systems.com/de/en/insights/newsroom/expert-blogs/healthcare-transformation-with-private-cloud-711666</a>','Sektor kesehatan saat ini sedang menghadapi tantangan besar dalam mengelola data pasien yang sangat sensitif, memastikan privasi dan keamanan, serta menyediakan layanan yang efisien dan responsif. …','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/web_Manfaat-Private-Cloud-min-1.png','published','2024-06-13','2024-06-13')
