<ul>
 	<li>Dedicated Teams</li>
 	<li>Certified Engineer</li>
 	<li>Award-Winning</li>
 	<li>Demo Solutions Center</li>
 	<li>Trusted Partner</li>
</ul>','Dalam layanan kesehatan modern, kebutuhan akan pertukaran data medis antar fasilitas kesehatan semakin meningkat. Namun pada banyak rumah sakit, data medical imaging seperti CT Scan, MRI, dan X-Ray…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Avatar-EDM-Eps-5-1.png','published','2026-05-11','2026-05-11')
