<a href="https://blogs.vmware.com/cloud-foundation/2026/05/05/vcf-9-1-secure-cost-effective-private-cloud-platform-for-production-ai/">https://blogs.vmware.com/cloud-foundation/2026/05/05/vcf-9-1-secure-cost-effective-private-cloud-platform-for-production-ai/</a>

https://my.idc.com/getdoc.jsp?containerId=prUS53765225&amp;_gl=1*1xbx6s8*_ga*NTYzNzgzNjUyLjE3NTMxNTE1MjY.*_ga_541ENG1F9X*czE3NTYyMTgyMTAkbzY2JGcxJHQxNzU2MjE4MjE4JGo1MiRsMCRoMA..*_gcl_au*MTkxODQzMjIwLjE3NTAwNzkyODYuMTA0NzQzNjYzNC4xNzU0NDI1OTM4LjE3NTQ0MjU5Mzg

&nbsp;

&nbsp;','Satu Dasbor Sentral untuk Menyederhanakan Pengelolaan Infrastruktur AI Penerapan Artificial Intelligence (AI) di berbagai sektor industri saat ini tumbuh sangat pesat. Data dari IDC Global mempredi…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/EDM-vmware-vcf.png','published','2026-07-20','2026-07-20')
