<ul>
 	<li>Dedicated Teams</li>
 	<li>Certified Engineer</li>
 	<li>Award-Winning</li>
 	<li>Demo Solutions Center</li>
 	<li>Trusted Partner</li>
</ul>
Referensi : <a href="https://www.nutanix.com/blog/nutanix-agentic-ai-scaling-next-generation-of-intelligence">https://www.nutanix.com/blog/nutanix-agentic-ai-scaling-next-generation-of-intelligence#</a>','Adopsi kecerdasan buatan ( Artificial Intelligence ) di dunia bisnis telah mencapai titik balik yang signifikan. Jika sebelumnya penggunaan AI di tingkat konsumen diwarnai oleh asisten digital pers…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/EDM-Nutanix-AI.png','published','2026-07-29','2026-07-29')
