Ref : <a href="https://www.dell.com/en-us/blog/how-smb-manufacturers-use-ai-to-outpace-bigger-competitors/">https://www.dell.com/en-us/blog/how-smb-manufacturers-use-ai-to-outpace-bigger-competitors/</a>','Dalam industri manufaktur skala menengah, margin keuntungan ditentukan oleh dua hal: kecepatan dan keandalan . Ketika satu mesin mati secara tiba-tiba ( unplanned downtime ) atau satu lini produksi…','https://saptatunas.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/EDM-Dell-Power-Edge.png','published','2026-08-31','2026-09-09')
